{
  "title": "sink",
  "release": "Archetypes",
  "body": "sink\nand get addicted\ninan endless winter of the mind.\n\nsink\nand I despair\ni turn off the lights and the thoughts go elsewhere.\n\nI fall again like rain towards the void\nand endurance like drizzles in the ocean;\nand I sink..\n\nsink\nand tune in\nin the frequencies of a barren life.\n\nsink\nand disarm\ni get rid of the servants of pleasure.\n\nI fall again like rain towards the void...",
